{
 "about": "The run directories (relative to the unpacked run archive, runs/) that the analyses of the released result files use. analysis_pipeline.run_all, analysis_pipeline.primary and analysis_pipeline.figures.perdb_extract read this file and analyse exactly these directories; roles such as full_fixed are resolved inside this set. The directories R3 (seed and control re-runs, temperature 0.7) and R4T0 (temperature-0 re-runs) are not in it on purpose: they repeat the configuration of a headline run and have their own entry points (code/tools/r3_*.py, code/tools/r4_t0.py). 'roles' documents the runs that fill the five roles of results/primary.json; it is a cross-check (tests/test_replay_manifest.py), not an input.",
